    <div class="container body-content" id="content"> 
        <div role="main">
            
<div class="container" role="search">
    <div class="heading" role="heading" aria-level="1">FreeText Document Search</div>
    <div>
        <p>Here you have the option to do a full-text search in all documents (agenda, minutes, agenda items, attachments, etc...)</p>
        <p><strong>Search instructions:</strong><br />To get results, you need to check at least one checkbox and enter a search term.<br />The search term will be matched anywhere in a word.<br />To find words starting with your term please add a space before it. Equally adding a space after the term finds anything ending with it.<br />To get better results, try to be specific about the term and dates.<br /> You are able to combine two words, by using AND or OR. Example: <em>forest OR mountain</em></p>
        <p>Note: Non public documents will only show up, if you have the rights to see those.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="filter">
        <form method="post" action="/iip/elpaso/search">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-lg-2">
                    <label for="SearchFilters_SearchString">Enter a search term</label>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-2">
                    <input value="" type="text" id="SearchFilters_SearchString" name="SearchFilters.SearchString" />
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-lg-2">
                    <label for="SearchFilters_Limit">How many results?</label>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-2">
                    <input value="50" type="number" data-val="true" data-val-required="The Limit field is required." id="SearchFilters_Limit" name="SearchFilters.Limit" />
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-lg-2 col-md-12 col-sm-12">
                    <label for="SearchFilters_SelectedOrganizationFilterId">Organization</label>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-10 col-md-12 col-sm-12">
                    <select style="max-width:300px;" data-val="true" data-val-required="The SelectedOrganizationFilterId field is required." id="SearchFilters_SelectedOrganizationFilterId" name="SearchFilters.SelectedOrganizationFilterId">
                        <option>Please select</option>
                    <option value="3">Board of Adjustment</option>
<option value="1">Board of County Commissioners</option>
<option value="82">Board of County Commissioners (Informal)</option>
<option value="81">Board of County Commissioners (Land Use)</option>
<option value="54">Board of County Commissioners Work Session</option>
<option value="5">Board of Retirement</option>
